ur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过 Toggle Enchantments，您可以启用或禁用附魔。只需按下 R 键即可打开切换菜单，您还可以将不希望启用的附魔加入黑名单，以限制其在服务器上的使用。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/m1sA1sf.gif\" width=\"411\" height=\"232\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/V9IIYlR.gif\" width=\"411\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常见问题 (FAQ)</strong></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：打开切换菜单的按键是什么？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：按键是“<strong>R</strong>”，您可以在按键设置中更改它。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：它是否支持其他模组的附魔？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的，您可以切换所有原版和外部模组的附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：我可以将 Toggle Enchantments 包含在我的整合包中吗？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：当然可以，只需在相关项目中列出我的模组即可。</span></p>",
